  m_Name: Step_11_JoinClientToDomain
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScreenshotStepData
  stepId: Step_11_JoinClientToDomain
  instructionText: 'LO2.4 - Move to CLIENT01.


    A client that is not a domain
    member cannot use domain accounts, receive Group Policy, or be managed from the
    server - so nothing after this point would work.


    On the client: System
    Properties > Change > select ''Domain'', and type the domain name. Authenticate
    as the domain administrator, then restart.'
